    {
      "id": "equilibrium-dynamics",
      "kind": "content",
      "headline": "市场均衡与自发调节",
      "lead": "短缺与过剩是价格信号失灵的表象，而自发调节是市场恢复秩序的机制。",
      "notes": "上一页我们分别掌握了需求与供给定律，现在把两者放在一起，就能看到价格这只“看不见的手”如何通过自发调节消除短缺或过剩，最终收敛到均衡点。这里要特别提醒大家，不要误以为“均衡”就是静止不变或绝对完美的状态，它本质上只是一个市场出清的动态过程。刚才的模拟给出了直观感受，下一页我们将把这种直觉转化为严谨的代数语言，用具体的数学方程来求解均衡价格与数量。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "sim",
          "engine": "widget",
          "html": "<style>\n  .widget { display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; background: var(--bg); color: var(--ink); font-family: var(--sans); }\n  #stage { flex: 1; width: 100%; min-height: 0; display: block; }\n  .readout-row { display: flex; gap: 24px; padding: 12px 20px; background: var(--bg2); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .readout-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }\n  .label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text2); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }\n  .val { font-size: 16px; color: var(--accent); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .grid-line { stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 0.5; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }\n  .axis { stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }\n  .curve { stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }\n  .price-line { stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 2; cursor: grab; transition: stroke-width 150ms; }\n  .price-line:hover { stroke-width: 3; }\n  .price-line:active { cursor: grabbing; }\n  .area { fill: var(--accent); opacity: 0.15; }\n  .construction { stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 0.8; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }\n  .arrow-part { stroke: var(--accent); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }\n  .arrow-head { stroke: none; fill: var(--accent); }\n  .dim-text { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 10px; fill: var(--text2); }\n  .area-label { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 14px; fill: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; text-anchor: middle; }\n  .crop-mark { stroke: var(--line); stroke-width: 1; fill: none; }\n  .eq-label { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 11px; fill: var(--ink); }\n</style>\n<div class=\"widget\">\n  <svg id=\"stage\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n    <g id=\"grid\"></g>\n    <g id=\"crop-marks\">\n      <path class=\"crop-mark\" d=\"M 60 50 L 60 40 L 70 40\" />\n      <path class=\"crop-mark\" d=\"M 530 40 L 540 40 L 540 50\" />\n      <path class=\"crop-mark\" d=\"M 60 330 L 60 340 L 70 340\" />\n      <path class=\"crop-mark\" d=\"M 530 340 L 540 340 L 540 330\" />\n    </g>\n    <polygon id=\"surplus\" class=\"area\" points=\"\" />\n    <polygon id=\"shortage\" class=\"area\" points=\"\" />\n    <g id=\"construction\">\n      <line id=\"cons-qs-x\" class=\"construction\" />\n      <line id=\"cons-qd-x\" class=\"construction\" />\n      <line id=\"cons-qs-y\" class=\"construction\" />\n      <line id=\"cons-qd-y\" class=\"construction\" />\n    </g>\n    <line class=\"axis\" x1=\"60\" y1=\"340\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"340\" />\n    <line class=\"axis\" x1=\"60\" y1=\"340\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"40\" />\n    <line id=\"supply\" class=\"curve\" x1=\"60\" y1=\"340\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"40\" />\n    <line id=\"demand\" class=\"curve\" x1=\"60\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"340\" />\n    <circle id=\"eq-point\" cx=\"300\" cy=\"190\" r=\"4\" fill=\"var(--accent)\" stroke=\"var(--bg)\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n    <text class=\"eq-label\" x=\"308\" y=\"186\">E</text>\n    <line id=\"price-line\" class=\"price-line\" x1=\"60\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"0\" />\n    <g id=\"pressure-arrow\" style=\"display:none\">\n      <line id=\"arrow-line\" class=\"arrow-part\" />\n      <line id=\"arrow-tick1\" class=\"arrow-part\" />\n      <line id=\"arrow-tick2\" class=\"arrow-part\" />\n      <path id=\"arrow-head\" class=\"arrow-head\" />\n    </g>\n    <text id=\"label-qs\" class=\"dim-text\" text-anchor=\"middle\"></text>\n    <text id=\"label-qd\" class=\"dim-text\" text-anchor=\"middle\"></text>\n    <text id=\"label-price\" class=\"dim-text\" text-anchor=\"end\"></text>\n    <text id=\"label-area\" class=\"area-label\"></text>\n    <text class=\"dim-text\" x=\"540\" y=\"358\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Q</text>\n    <text class=\"dim-text\" x=\"48\" y=\"45\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">P</text>\n    <text class=\"dim-text\" x=\"545\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">D</text>\n    <text class=\"dim-text\" x=\"545\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"end\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">S</text>\n  </svg>\n  <div class=\"readout-row\">\n    <div class=\"readout-item\">\n      <span class=\"label\">价格 P</span>\n      <span class=\"val mono\" id=\"r-price\">7.50</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"readout-item\">\n      <span class=\"label\">供给量 Qs</span>\n      <span class=\"val mono\" id=\"r-qs\">7.50</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"readout-item\">\n      <span class=\"label\">需求量 Qd</span>\n      <span class=\"val mono\" id=\"r-qd\">2.50</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n  const svg = document.getElementById('stage');\n  const priceLine = document.getElementById('price-line');\n  const surplus = document.getElementById('surplus');\n  const shortage = document.getElementById('shortage');\n  const consQsX = document.getElementById('cons-qs-x');\n  const consQdX = document.getElementById('cons-qd-x');\n  const consQsY = document.getElementById('cons-qs-y');\n  const consQdY = document.getElementById('cons-qd-y');\n  const pressureArrow = document.getElementById('pressure-arrow');\n  const arrowLine = document.getElementById('arrow-line');\n  const arrowTick1 = document.getElementById('arrow-tick1');\n  const arrowTick2 = document.getElementById('arrow-tick2');\n  const arrowHead = document.getElementById('arrow-head');\n  const labelQs = document.getElementById('label-qs');\n  const labelQd = document.getElementById('label-qd');\n  const labelPrice = document.getElementById('label-price');\n  const labelArea = document.getElementById('label-area');\n  const rPrice = document.getElementById('r-price');\n  const rQs = document.getElementById('r-qs');\n  const rQd = document.getElementById('r-qd');\n\n  const x = q => 60 + q * 48;\n  const y = p => 340 - p * 30;\n  const pFromY = yv => (340 - yv) / 30;\n\n  const gridG = document.getElementById('grid');\n  for (let i = 1; i < 10; i++) {\n    const gl1 = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');\n    gl1.setAttribute('x1', 60); gl1.setAttribute('y1', y(i));\n    gl1.setAttribute('x2', 540); gl1.setAttribute('y2', y(i));\n    gl1.setAttribute('class', 'grid-line');\n    gridG.appendChild(gl1);\n\n    const gl2 = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'line');\n    gl2.setAttribute('x1', x(i)); gl2.setAttribute('y1', 40);\n    gl2.setAttribute('x2', x(i)); gl2.setAttribute('y2', 340);\n    gl2.setAttribute('class', 'grid-line');\n    gridG.appendChild(gl2);\n  }\n\n  let state = { price: 7.5, eqPrice: 5.0, dragging: false, animating: true };\n\n  function update() {\n    const P = state.price;\n    const Qs = P;\n    const Qd = 10 - P;\n    const Ep = state.eqPrice;\n    const Eq = 5;\n    const py = y(P);\n\n    priceLine.setAttribute('y1', py);\n    priceLine.setAttribute('y2', py);\n\n    if (P > Ep + 0.05) {\n      surplus.setAttribute('points', `${x(Qd)},${py} ${x(Qs)},${py} ${x(Eq)},${y(Ep)}`);\n      surplus.style.display = '';\n      shortage.style.display = 'none';\n      labelArea.textContent = '过剩';\n      labelArea.setAttribute('x', x((Qd + Qs) / 2));\n      labelArea.setAttribute('y', (py + y(Ep)) / 2 + 5);\n      \n      const arrowX = x((Qd + Qs) / 2);\n      const arrowY1 = py - 25;\n      const arrowY2 = py - 8;\n      arrowLine.setAttribute('x1', arrowX); arrowLine.setAttribute('y1', arrowY1);\n      arrowLine.setAttribute('x2', arrowX); arrowLine.setAttribute('y2', arrowY2);\n      arrowTick1.setAttribute('x1', arrowX - 4); arrowTick1.setAttribute('y1', arrowY1);\n      arrowTick1.setAttribute('x2', arrowX + 4); arrowTick1.setAttribute('y2', arrowY1);\n      arrowTick2.setAttribute('x1', arrowX - 4); arrowTick2.setAttribute('y1', arrowY2);\n      arrowTick2.setAttribute('x2', arrowX + 4); arrowTick2.setAttribute('y2', arrowY2);\n      arrowHead.setAttribute('d', `M ${arrowX - 5} ${arrowY2 - 6} L ${arrowX} ${arrowY2} L ${arrowX + 5} ${arrowY2 - 6}`);\n      pressureArrow.style.display = '';\n    } else if (P < Ep - 0.05) {\n      shortage.setAttribute('points', `${x(Qs)},${py} ${x(Qd)},${py} ${x(Eq)},${y(Ep)}`);\n      shortage.style.display = '';\n      surplus.style.display = 'none';\n      labelArea.textContent = '短缺';\n      labelArea.setAttribute('x', x((Qd + Qs) / 2));\n      labelArea.setAttribute('y', (py + y(Ep)) / 2 + 5);\n      \n      const arrowX = x((Qd + Qs) / 2);\n      const arrowY1 = py + 25;\n      const arrowY2 = py + 8;\n      arrowLine.setAttribute('x1', arrowX); arrowLine.setAttribute('y1', arrowY1);\n      arrowLine.setAttribute('x2', arrowX); arrowLine.setAttribute('y2', arrowY2);\n      arrowTick1.setAttribute('x1', arrowX - 4); arrowTick1.setAttribute('y1', arrowY1);\n      arrowTick1.setAttribute('x2', arrowX + 4); arrowTick1.setAttribute('y2', arrowY1);\n      arrowTick2.setAttribute('x1', arrowX - 4); arrowTick2.setAttribute('y1', arrowY2);\n      arrowTick2.setAttribute('x2', arrowX + 4); arrowTick2.setAttribute('y2', arrowY2);\n      arrowHead.setAttribute('d', `M ${arrowX - 5} ${arrowY2 + 6} L ${arrowX} ${arrowY2} L ${arrowX + 5} ${arrowY2 + 6}`);\n      pressureArrow.style.display = '';\n    } else {\n      surplus.style.display = 'none';\n      shortage.style.display = 'none';\n      pressureArrow.style.display = 'none';\n      labelArea.textContent = '';\n    }\n\n    consQsX.setAttribute('x1', x(Qs)); consQsX.setAttribute('y1', py);\n    consQsX.setAttribute('x2', x(Qs)); consQsX.setAttribute('y2', 340);\n    consQdX.setAttribute('x1', x(Qd)); consQdX.setAttribute('y1', py);\n    consQdX.setAttribute('x2', x(Qd)); consQdX.setAttribute('y2', 340);\n    consQsY.setAttribute('x1', 60); consQsY.setAttribute('y1', py);\n    consQsY.setAttribute('x2', x(Qs)); consQsY.setAttribute('y2', py);\n    consQdY.setAttribute('x1', 60); consQdY.setAttribute('y1', py);\n    consQdY.setAttribute('x2', x(Qd)); consQdY.setAttribute('y2', py);\n\n    labelQs.setAttribute('x', x(Qs)); labelQs.setAttribute('y', 358); labelQs.textContent = Qs.toFixed(1);\n    labelQd.setAttribute('x', x(Qd)); labelQd.setAttribute('y', 358); labelQd.textContent = Qd.toFixed(1);\n    labelPrice.setAttribute('x', 55); labelPrice.setAttribute('y', py + 4); labelPrice.textContent = P.toFixed(1);\n\n    rPrice.textContent = P.toFixed(2);\n    rQs.textContent = Qs.toFixed(2);\n    rQd.textContent = Qd.toFixed(2);\n  }\n\n  function getSVGPoint(evt) {\n    const pt = svg.createSVGPoint();\n    pt.x = evt.clientX;\n    pt.y = evt.clientY;\n    return pt.matrixTransform(svg.getScreenCTM().inverse());\n  }\n\n  priceLine.addEventListener('pointerdown', e => {\n    state.dragging = true;\n    state.animating = false;\n    priceLine.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);\n  });\n\n  priceLine.addEventListener('pointermove', e => {\n    if (!state.dragging) return;\n    const svgPt = getSVGPoint(e);\n    let newPrice = pFromY(svgPt.y);\n    newPrice = Math.max(0.5, Math.min(9.5, newPrice));\n    state.price = Math.round(newPrice * 100) / 100;\n    update();\n  });\n\n  window.addEventListener('pointerup', () => {\n    if (state.dragging) {\n      state.dragging = false;\n      state.animating = true;\n    }\n  });\n\n  function loop() {\n    if (state.animating && !state.dragging) {\n      const diff = state.eqPrice - state.price;\n      if (Math.abs(diff) < 0.02) {\n        state.price = state.eqPrice;\n        state.animating = false;\n      } else {\n        state.price += diff * 0.04;\n      }\n      update();\n    }\n    requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n  }\n\n  update();\n  requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n</script>",
          "id": "b_eq_sim"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "label": "供给时滞",
          "text": "当供给存在时滞（如生猪养殖需 6 个月才能出栏），价格不会瞬间收敛，而可能在均衡点附近振荡甚至发散，形成**蛛网模型**。",
          "id": "b_cobweb"
        }
      ],
      "layout": {
        "kind": "compose",
        "preset": "sidenote"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "math-derivation",
      "kind": "content",
      "eyebrow": "理论推导",
      "headline": "均衡的数学结构",
      "lead": "供需曲线背后是微观主体的最优化行为，均衡点是方程组的联立解。",
      "notes": "上一页我们用直觉讨论了市场如何自发调节，现在我们用数学把这个过程精确化：令需求量等于供给量，解出的价格就是让市场出清的均衡价格。大家要特别注意，经济学习惯把价格放在纵轴，但需求函数常写成 Q = a - bP，解方程时千万别把斜率或正负号弄反了，要时刻记住解出的 P* 背后代表的是短缺或过剩为零的状态。掌握了这个基础的等式 Qd(P) = Qs(P)，下一页我们引入税收时，只需把它升级为买方支付价格与卖方收到价格不相等的情况，就能顺理成章地推导税负归宿了。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "\\begin{aligned}\nQ_d &= a - bP \\\\\nQ_s &= c + dP \\\\\n\\hline \\\\\nQ_d &= Q_s \\\\\na - bP &= c + dP \\\\\nP^* &= \\frac{a-c}{b+d}\n\\end{aligned}",
          "caption": "令需求等于供给，解得均衡价格 $P^*$；其中 $a>c$ 保证正价格，$b,d>0$ 保证曲线斜率符号正确。",
          "id": "b_eq_formula"
        },
        {
          "type": "flow",
          "nodes": [
            {
              "title": "外生冲击",
              "sub": "消费者收入 $I$ 上升"
            },
            {
              "title": "需求曲线右移",
              "sub": "$D_0 \\to D_1$，各价格下 $Q_d$ 增加"
            },
            {
              "title": "原价下短缺",
              "sub": "原 $P^*_0$ 处 $Q_d > Q_s$，出现短缺"
            },
            {
              "title": "价格机制调整",
              "sub": "价格沿 $S$ 曲线上升"
            },
