    {
      "id": "tax-wedge",
      "kind": "content",
      "eyebrow": "政策分析",
      "headline": "税收楔子与税负归宿",
      "lead": "税收在供需之间打入一个楔子，最终谁买单不由谁交税决定，而由弹性决定。",
      "notes": "上一页我们用联立方程求解了无税均衡，现在引入税收相当于在买卖价格间打入一个“楔子”，即买方支付价减去卖方收到价恰好等于税额。大家常误以为“向谁征税谁就承担全部成本”，但法定归宿不等于经济归宿，真正的税负分配完全取决于供需弹性：谁更缺乏弹性（更跑不掉），谁承担的税负就越多。这与下一页要讲的价格管制不同，税收是让市场在楔子作用下重新寻找均衡，而价格管制则是直接冻结价格机制。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "sim",
          "engine": "widget",
          "html": "<style>\n  .container {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    height: 100%;\n    gap: 12px;\n    padding: 16px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n  }\n  .controls {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 16px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .control-group {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 140px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  label {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--text2);\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  input[type=range] {\n    flex: 1;\n    accent-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .val {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    min-width: 36px;\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n  button {\n    background: var(--card);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    padding: 8px 16px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    transition: all 150ms;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  button:hover {\n    background: var(--accent);\n    color: var(--bg);\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  button:active {\n    transform: scale(0.97);\n  }\n  .stage-wrapper {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-height: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .readouts {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 24px;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: var(--text2);\n  }\n  .readout-val {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    margin-left: 4px;\n    transition: color 300ms;\n  }\n  .readout-val.flash {\n    color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  svg text {\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n    user-select: none;\n  }\n  line, circle {\n    transition: all 200ms linear;\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <div class=\"control-group\">\n      <label for=\"demand_slope\">需求斜率</label>\n      <input type=\"range\" id=\"demand_slope\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"3.0\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1.5\">\n      <span class=\"val mono\" id=\"demand_slope-val\">1.5</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"control-group\">\n      <label for=\"supply_slope\">供给斜率</label>\n      <input type=\"range\" id=\"supply_slope\" min=\"0.5\" max=\"3.0\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1.0\">\n      <span class=\"val mono\" id=\"supply_slope-val\">1.0</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"control-group\">\n      <label for=\"tax\">税额</label>\n      <input type=\"range\" id=\"tax\" min=\"0\" max=\"4\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"2.0\">\n      <span class=\"val mono\" id=\"tax-val\">2.0</span>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"tax_target\">向生产者征税</button>\n  </div>\n  \n  <div class=\"stage-wrapper\">\n    <svg id=\"stage\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 400\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;display:block;\">\n      <rect width=\"680\" height=\"400\" fill=\"var(--bg)\"/>\n      <defs>\n        <pattern id=\"grid\" width=\"25\" height=\"28\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\">\n          <path d=\"M 25 0 L 0 0 0 28\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--line)\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" opacity=\"0.4\"/>\n        </pattern>\n      </defs>\n      <rect x=\"80\" y=\"60\" width=\"500\" height=\"280\" fill=\"url(#grid)\"/>\n      \n      <g id=\"crop-marks\" stroke=\"var(--line)\" stroke-width=\"1\" opacity=\"0.5\">\n        <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"60\"/>\n        <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"50\"/>\n        <line x1=\"590\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"590\" y2=\"60\"/>\n        <line x1=\"590\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"580\" y2=\"50\"/>\n        <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"350\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"340\"/>\n        <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"350\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"350\"/>\n        <line x1=\"590\" y1=\"350\" x2=\"590\" y2=\"340\"/>\n        <line x1=\"590\" y1=\"350\" x2=\"580\" y2=\"350\"/>\n      </g>\n\n      <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"340\" x2=\"580\" y2=\"340\" stroke=\"var(--line)\" stroke-width=\"1\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/>\n      <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"340\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"60\" stroke=\"var(--line)\" stroke-width=\"1\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/>\n      <text x=\"580\" y=\"355\" fill=\"var(--text2)\" font-family=\"var(--mono)\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">Q</text>\n      <text x=\"75\" y=\"60\" fill=\"var(--text2)\" font-family=\"var(--mono)\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\">P</text>\n\n      <polygon id=\"consumer-burden\" fill=\"var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0.2\"/>\n      <polygon id=\"producer-burden\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" opacity=\"0.15\"/>\n      <polygon id=\"dwl\" fill=\"var(--text2)\" opacity=\"0.3\"/>\n\n      <line id=\"tax-q-line\" stroke=\"var(--line)\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/>\n      \n      <line id=\"demand-line\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"2\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/>\n      <line id=\"supply-line\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/>\n      <line id=\"shifted-line\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/>\n\n      <path id=\"c-burden-measure\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/>\n      <path id=\"p-burden-measure\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/>\n      <path id=\"tax-measure\" stroke=\"var(--text2)\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/>\n\n      <text id=\"c-burden-label\" fill=\"var(--accent)\" font-family=\"var(--mono)\" font-size=\"11\"></text>\n      <text id=\"p-burden-label\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-family=\"var(--mono)\" font-size=\"11\"></text>\n      <text id=\"tax-label\" fill=\"var(--text2)\" font-family=\"var(--mono)\" font-size=\"11\"></text>\n\n      <text id=\"demand-label\" fill=\"var(--accent)\" font-family=\"var(--mono)\" font-size=\"11\"></text>\n      <text id=\"supply-label\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-family=\"var(--mono)\" font-size=\"11\"></text>\n      <text id=\"shifted-label\" fill=\"var(--text2)\" font-family=\"var(--mono)\" font-size=\"11\"></text>\n\n      <circle id=\"eq-point\" r=\"3\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/>\n      <circle id=\"tax-point-d\" r=\"3\" fill=\"var(--accent)\"/>\n      <circle id=\"tax-point-s\" r=\"3\" fill=\"var(--ink)\"/>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"readouts\">\n    <div>消费者税负 <span class=\"readout-val mono\" id=\"c-burden-val\">0%</span></div>\n    <div>生产者税负 <span class=\"readout-val mono\" id=\"p-burden-val\">0%</span></div>\n    <div>无谓损失 <span class=\"readout-val mono\" id=\"dwl-val\">0</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n  const state = {\n    demand_slope: 1.5,\n    supply_slope: 1.0,\n    tax: 2.0,\n    tax_target: 'consumer'\n  };\n\n  function setLine(id, x1, y1, x2, y2) {\n    const el = document.getElementById(id);\n    el.setAttribute('x1', x1);\n    el.setAttribute('y1', y1);\n    el.setAttribute('x2', x2);\n    el.setAttribute('y2', y2);\n  }\n\n  function setPolygon(id, points) {\n    const el = document.getElementById(id);\n    el.setAttribute('points', points.map(p => p.join(',')).join(' '));\n  }\n\n  function setVertMeasure(id, x, y1, y2) {\n    const el = document.getElementById(id);\n    const t = 4;\n    el.setAttribute('d', `M${x-t},${y1} L${x+t},${y1} M${x},${y1} L${x},${y2} M${x-t},${y2} L${x+t},${y2}`);\n  }\n\n  function setText(id, x, y, text, anchor, baseline) {\n    const el = document.getElementById(id);\n    el.setAttribute('x', x);\n    el.setAttribute('y', y);\n    el.setAttribute('text-anchor', anchor || 'start');\n    el.setAttribute('dominant-baseline', baseline || 'auto');\n    el.textContent = text;\n  }\n\n  function setCircle(id, cx, cy) {\n    const el = document.getElementById(id);\n    el.setAttribute('cx', cx);\n    el.setAttribute('cy', cy);\n  }\n\n  function flashReadout(id) {\n    const el = document.getElementById(id);\n    el.classList.remove('flash');\n    void el.offsetWidth;\n    el.classList.add('flash');\n  }\n\n  function update() {\n    const ds = state.demand_slope;\n    const ss = state.supply_slope;\n    const t = state.tax;\n    const tt = state.tax_target;\n\n    const Q_eq = 10 / (ds + ss);\n    const P_eq = ss * Q_eq;\n\n    const Q_tax = Math.max(0, (10 - t) / (ds + ss));\n    const P_s = ss * Q_tax;\n    const P_d = 10 - ds * Q_tax;\n\n    const ox = 80, oy = 340;\n    const sx = 25, sy = 28;\n\n    const Q_eq_x = ox + Q_eq * sx;\n    const P_eq_y = oy - P_eq * sy;\n    const Q_tax_x = ox + Q_tax * sx;\n    const P_d_y = oy - P_d * sy;\n    const P_s_y = oy - P_s * sy;\n\n    setLine('demand-line', ox, oy - 10*sy, ox + (10/ds)*sx, oy);\n    setLine('supply-line', ox, oy, ox + (10/ss)*sx, oy - 10*sy);\n\n    const shiftedLine = document.getElementById('shifted-line');\n    if (tt === 'consumer') {\n      setLine('shifted-line', ox, oy - (10-t)*sy, ox + ((10-t)/ds)*sx, oy);\n      shiftedLine.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--accent)');\n      setText('shifted-label', ox + 5, oy - (10-t)*sy + 15, '需求-税', 'start', 'auto');\n    } else {\n      setLine('shifted-line', ox, oy - t*sy, ox + ((10-t)/ss)*sx, oy - 10*sy);\n      shiftedLine.setAttribute('stroke', 'var(--ink)');\n      setText('shifted-label', ox + 5, oy - t*sy + 15, '供给+税', 'start', 'auto');\n    }\n\n    setPolygon('consumer-burden', [\n      [ox, P_eq_y], [Q_tax_x, P_eq_y], [Q_tax_x, P_d_y], [ox, P_d_y]\n    ]);\n    setPolygon('producer-burden', [\n      [ox, P_eq_y], [Q_tax_x, P_eq_y], [Q_tax_x, P_s_y], [ox, P_s_y]\n    ]);\n    setPolygon('dwl', [\n      [Q_tax_x, P_d_y], [Q_eq_x, P_eq_y], [Q_tax_x, P_s_y]\n    ]);\n\n    setLine('tax-q-line', Q_tax_x, P_d_y, Q_tax_x, oy);\n\n    setVertMeasure('c-burden-measure', ox - 15, P_eq_y, P_d_y);\n    setVertMeasure('p-burden-measure', ox - 15, P_s_y, P_eq_y);\n    setVertMeasure('tax-measure', Q_tax_x + 15, P_s_y, P_d_y);\n\n    setText('c-burden-label', ox - 20, (P_eq_y + P_d_y) / 2, (P_d - P_eq).toFixed(1), 'end', 'middle');\n    setText('p-burden-label', ox - 20, (P_s_y + P_eq_y) / 2, (P_eq - P_s).toFixed(1), 'end', 'middle');\n    setText('tax-label', Q_tax_x + 20, (P_s_y + P_d_y) / 2, t.toFixed(1), 'start', 'middle');\n\n    setText('demand-label', ox + (10/ds)*sx - 5, oy - 10, '需求', 'end', 'auto');\n    setText('supply-label', ox + (10/ss)*sx - 5, oy - 10*sy + 15, '供给', 'end', 'auto');\n\n    setCircle('eq-point', Q_eq_x, P_eq_y);\n    setCircle('tax-point-d', Q_tax_x, P_d_y);\n    setCircle('tax-point-s', Q_tax_x, P_s_y);\n\n    const cBurden = t > 0 ? ((P_d - P_eq) / t * 100) : 0;\n    const pBurden = t > 0 ? ((P_eq - P_s) / t * 100) : 0;\n    const dwl = 0.5 * (Q_eq - Q_tax) * t;\n\n    const cBurdenStr = cBurden.toFixed(1) + '%';\n    const pBurdenStr = pBurden.toFixed(1) + '%';\n    const dwlStr = dwl.toFixed(2);\n\n    if (document.getElementById('c-burden-val').textContent !== cBurdenStr) {\n      document.getElementById('c-burden-val').textContent = cBurdenStr;\n      flashReadout('c-burden-val');\n    }\n    if (document.getElementById('p-burden-val').textContent !== pBurdenStr) {\n      document.getElementById('p-burden-val').textContent = pBurdenStr;\n      flashReadout('p-burden-val');\n    }\n    if (document.getElementById('dwl-val').textContent !== dwlStr) {\n      document.getElementById('dwl-val').textContent = dwlStr;\n      flashReadout('dwl-val');\n    }\n  }\n\n  document.getElementById('demand_slope').addEventListener('input', e => {\n    state.demand_slope = parseFloat(e.target.value);\n    document.getElementById('demand_slope-val').textContent = state.demand_slope.toFixed(1);\n    update();\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('supply_slope').addEventListener('input', e => {\n    state.supply_slope = parseFloat(e.target.value);\n    document.getElementById('supply_slope-val').textContent = state.supply_slope.toFixed(1);\n    update();\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('tax').addEventListener('input', e => {\n    state.tax = parseFloat(e.target.value);\n    document.getElementById('tax-val').textContent = state.tax.toFixed(1);\n    update();\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('tax_target').addEventListener('click', () => {\n    state.tax_target = state.tax_target === 'consumer' ? 'producer' : 'consumer';\n    document.getElementById('tax_target').textContent = state.tax_target === 'consumer' ? '向生产者征税' : '向消费者征税';\n    update();\n  });\n\n  update();\n</script>",
          "id": "b_tax_sim"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "label": "弹性法则",
          "text": "需求越缺乏弹性，消费者承担税负越多——香烟需求弹性约 $-0.4$，每包加税 1 元后消费者多付约 0.7 元；供给越缺乏弹性，则生产者承担越多。",
          "id": "b_elasticity_rule"
        }
      ],
      "layout": {
        "kind": "compose",
        "preset": "sidenote"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "price-control",
      "kind": "content",
      "headline": "价格管制与市场扭曲",
      "lead": "限价与配额看似保护弱势群体，实则切断了价格信号，导致非均衡状态持续。",
      "notes": "刚才的税收楔子是政府通过价差干预，而价格管制则是直接按死价格，必然引发非自愿的短缺或过剩；同学们常误以为限价能惠及所有消费者，却忽略了在短缺中根本买不到商品的那部分人被挤出市场；当这种人为扭曲不断积累，供需曲线的假设就不再成立，这也自然引出了下一页我们要探讨的模型失效边界。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "diagramType": "snake",
          "nodes": [
            {
              "title": "价格上限低于均衡",
              "sub": "租金管制：最高限价 < 市场出清价"
            },
            {
              "title": "供不应求（短缺）",
              "sub": "Qd > Qs"
            },
            {
              "title": "排队·黑市·质量降",
              "sub": "非价格配给滋生隐性成本"
            },
            {
              "title": "价格下限高于均衡",
              "sub": "最低工资：最低价 > 市场出清价"
            },
            {
              "title": "供过于求（过剩）",
              "sub": "Qs > Qd"
            },
            {
              "title": "失业·销毁产能",
              "sub": "劳动力闲置与资源浪费"
            }
          ],
          "id": "b_control_diagram"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "lead": "租金管制压低价格引发短缺与质量降级",
              "text": "纽约市租金管制将租金压至均衡水平之下，导致供给量减少而需求量激增，产生长期短缺；房东因租金无法覆盖成本而削减维护，2019 年纽约近 **50%** 受租金稳定管制的建筑存在严重维护缺陷。",
              "icon": "dollar-sign"
            },
            {
              "lead": "最低工资抬高价格引发劳动力过剩",
              "text": "当法定最低工资高于市场均衡工资时，低技能劳动力供给量超过需求量，形成过剩（失业）；美国国会预算办公室（CBO）预测将联邦最低工资提至 **15 美元**/小时将导致约 **140 万**工人失去工作。",
              "icon": "briefcase"
            }
          ],
          "id": "b_rent_control"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "model-limits",
      "kind": "content",
      "eyebrow": "批判性思维",
      "headline": "供需模型的失效边界",
      "lead": "当理性人假设和信息完全假设崩塌，需求曲线可能向上倾斜，甚至直接消失。",
      "notes": "上一页我们讨论了价格管制如何在供需框架内造成扭曲，而这一页我们要退一步，审视供需模型本身的“失效边界”。大家要警惕一个常见误区：不要以为任何商品都能套用供需交叉图，当出现信息不对称、强外部性或垄断势力时，买卖双方不再是价格接受者，曲线本身会随行为内生变化，模型便失去了预测力。理解了这些假设前提的局限，我们就能在下一页更客观地总结这一经典工具的适用范围。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "grid",
          "columns": 2,
          "gap": 24,
          "items": [
            {
              "block": {
                "type": "callout",
                "label": "吉芬商品",
                "text": "低档必需品价涨量增，需求曲线斜率为正。**锚点**：1845 年爱尔兰大饥荒中的土豆——当土豆价格飙升，穷人实际收入锐减，被迫放弃相对昂贵的肉类，转而消费更多土豆以维持生存热量，$P \\uparrow$ 导致 $Q \\uparrow$。"
              }
            },
            {
              "block": {
                "type": "callout",
                "label": "凡勃伦效应",
                "text": "炫耀性消费中价格充当身份信号，价高反增需求。**锚点**：劳力士潜航者腕表——其公价约 9 万元，但二级市场溢价常超 50%，价格越高越能彰显购买力，需求反而从高价位爆发。"
              }
            },
            {
              "block": {
                "type": "callout",
                "label": "投机预期",
                "text": "追涨杀跌，对未来价格的预期取代当前价格驱动决策。**锚点**：2021 年 1 月 GameStop 股价——从 $20 飙升至 $480，散户因预期“还会涨”而疯狂买入，需求随价格正向飙升。"
              }
            },
            {
              "block": {
                "type": "callout",
                "label": "柠檬市场",
                "text": "信息不对称导致劣币驱逐良币，供需双向萎缩。**锚点**：二手车市场——卖家隐瞒车况，买家无法区分好车与“柠檬”（次品），只愿按均价出价；好车卖家亏损退出，市场最终只剩次品，均衡量远低于有效水平。"
              }
            }
          ],
          "id": "b_anomaly_grid"
        },
